{"id":"69c1a70d4ab11857","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-arithmetical-set.md","title":"Arithmetical Set","display":"df-arithmetical-set — Arithmetical Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-arithmetical-set","aliases":["68-df-arithmetical-set"],"display":"df-arithmetical-set — Arithmetical Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§13 definition p.43 and 13.1 p.44 / PDF 52-53","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-arithmetical-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-arithmetical-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-set — Arithmetical Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13 definition p.43 and 13.1 p.44 / PDF 52-53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arithmetical}\">\\(\\mathrm{Arithmetical}\\)</span> 为下式引入的一元集合谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arithmetical}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Sigma_n^0)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Pi_n^0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Arithmetical}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Sigma_n^0)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Pi_n^0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §13 的 arithmetical 适用于任意元数关系；本原子取一元集合特例。13.1 的量词收缩与 13.2 的虚量词添加说明两种并集相等，包括第 0 层的递归集合。谓词与等价条件均在 Assertion 给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}$ 见 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{Arithmetical}$ 为下式引入的一元集合谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arithmetical}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arithmetical}(A)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;A\\in\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Sigma_n^0)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in\\Pi_n^0).","display":true}],"bytes":1194,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-set]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-set]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-set|df-arithmetical-set — Arithmetical Set]]"}],"outgoing":["5e61d0905238a638"]}